4.—(1) Any person who parks a vehicle in any coupon parking place on the days and at the times indicated on any sign erected at that place shall display on the vehicle in the manner prescribed by rule 6 —
(a)one or more valid coupons in Form 1 or 2 in the Second Schedule having in the aggregate a value sufficient to meet the parking charges for the period during which the vehicle is parked or is to be parked in such parking place; or
[S 278/2018 wef 01/05/2018]
(b)a valid coupon in Form 3, 4, 5 or 6 in the Second Schedule.
(2) For the purposes of this rule, a parking coupon shall not be valid if —
(a)the coupon is so torn, defaced or mutilated that the figures or other particulars therein are not legible;
(b)the period of validity of the coupon has expired;
(c)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 1 or 2 in the Second Schedule, does not indicate the date and time of commencement of parking the vehicle in accordance with rule 7;
(d)the coupon, being a coupon in any of the Forms in the Second Schedule, is used in a manner contrary to the conditions, requirements or instructions given in the relevant Form or on a sign erected by the Superintendent at the parking place;
(e)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 3 in the Second Schedule, does not indicate the date and time (PM or AM) of commencement of parking the vehicle in accordance with rule 7;
(f)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 4 or 5 in the Second Schedule —
(i)does not indicate the date of parking the vehicle in accordance with rule 7; or
(ii)is used at a time when, or in a place where, the coupon does not entitle the holder to park at the parking place;
(g)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 5 in the Second Schedule, does not indicate in ink, the vehicle number of the motor car or bear the signature of a person authorised by the Superintendent to issue the coupon;
(h)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 5 or 6 in the Second Schedule, is used for the parking of a motor vehicle the vehicle number of which does not correspond to that indicated on the coupon; or
(i)the coupon, being a coupon in Form 6 in the Second Schedule —
(i)does not indicate in ink, the vehicle number of the motor cycle in accordance with the instructions given in the Form, or the date and time (day or night) of parking the vehicle in accordance with rule 7; or
(ii)is used for the parking of a motor vehicle other than a motor cycle.
